Subject: Re: Interpretation of standardized intercepts, and standardized effect sizes for measurement invariance testing
Message-ID: <kN5BRp4p_Wo.GC3W_FaAAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <kN5BRp4p_Wo.spcAijacAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
